Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:07.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:12.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:19.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:25.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:40.54,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:49.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:56.27,OP2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:01:06.01,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:11.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:16.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:23.01,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:18.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:24.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.71,0:22:30.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:37.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:47.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:53.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:59.61,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:06.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:14.53,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:20.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:26.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:33.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了！从森林那边来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师大人 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是四魂碎片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师大人 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让蜈蚣突然变得凶暴的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.65,0:02:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有什么事情尽管叫我就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师大人 谢礼…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 我收下这个就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是从我们村里出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师 珊瑚登场！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天上有好多星星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些星星的数量和四魂碎片的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个比较多呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来前面还有很长一段路要走啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不一定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那混蛋也跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在收集着四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样还可以省下不少工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要让那家伙去收集 然后我们一拼抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个计划不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到的四魂碎片越多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落就会变得更强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那时候就太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们得抢先收集更多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我这种小孩子都懂的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么就不懂呢？真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的脑子到底有多蠢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你收集到所有碎片以后有什么打算？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用问嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要变成真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不够强就什么都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算遇到看不顺眼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不够人家强的话就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你藉助四魂之玉的力量变成完全的妖怪以后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能保持自我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见过有谁用四魂碎片的力量做好事的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直有个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到四魂之玉之力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与此同时 也会失去心智
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不记得自己说过要变成好妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你想要保护戈薇小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你利用四魂之玉变成妖怪之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能就会把戈薇小姐和七宝吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连我都要吃？就不吃弥勒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.57,0:05:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会一早逃走的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在为止跟四魂之玉扯上关系的妖怪们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本就都不是好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是因为那样罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我…不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人把四魂碎片拿走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候拿走的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！快说！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有妖怪了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去找除妖师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大蜈蚣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪里像了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.34,0:05:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说除妖师？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来还有人以除妖为职业啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个除妖师在收集四魂之玉的碎片吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 她还说那个叫什么的玉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从她的村子流落出去的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你知道这件事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有四魂之玉的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它已经由桔梗在守护着了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉是怎么来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎物是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大蜈蚣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带回来一些脚和皮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以用来制作盔甲吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖哦 乖哦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有做好孩子啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来啦 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲他…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领叫你过去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 你得到四魂碎片了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样能镇住碎片的邪气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概50年前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把玉交给一位灵力高强的巫女保管
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并由她净化着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:27.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到那位大人最后…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是在争抢玉的战斗中去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是在找到能够净化玉的灵力高强的人之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把碎片收集到村里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并小心守护了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,净化玉的灵力…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就又有工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你也要做好准备哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经11岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该参加实战了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪真的会喷火喷毒的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我才没害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要收拾的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是一些大蛇和大蜘蛛罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲不是说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最可怕的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.27,0:08:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是伪装成人类的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.87,0:08:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种妖怪要是得到四魂之玉就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师 你们来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只大蜘蛛每晚都会来袭击城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城中已经有数人被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有办法收拾它吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 请交给我们处理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从村里挑选了几个高手来除妖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你说的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是像女人一样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连小孩子都有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在下的女儿和儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们村是数一数二的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚就请您见识他们的身手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到没？要加油哦 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父…父亲这个大骗子…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公 它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师 就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有妖怪出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少主的病之所以久治不愈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是因为妖怪的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公已经找来了除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场喧闹也只到今夜为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后只需期待少主您早日康复了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它围起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 压制住它了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为珊瑚是村里最好的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下子就把那个大蜘蛛给…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它脑袋打烂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是块头大了点 没什么了不起嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在太简单了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只蜘蛛的妖气也很弱…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 为什么要把父亲他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…连我都不认识了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 除妖师！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底在干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随他们去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是有趣的余兴节目
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丝…是蜘蛛丝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你干的好事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对姐弟都发疯了 杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快射下一箭 对准发疯的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥…琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐…我好怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.91,0:13:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怕…有我在…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两姐弟和好了啊 可喜可贺可喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主…主公…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少主 主公他到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就觉得父亲不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是被妖怪附身了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜了那些除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:26.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们埋到庭院一角去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真伤脑筋啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然没一个人知道除妖师的村落在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只知道在山里面啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 总之去找就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你要去除妖师的村子抢四魂碎片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别反而被除掉了就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 人家似乎是专业高手诶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我也很想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉为何会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还说四魂之玉本来就出自他们的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也一定很想知道原因吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事…真是让人讨厌的风
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么正在接近我们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且数量很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一大群妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好强的妖气…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是一般的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 诡异得让人恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们想去攻击什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对除妖师姐弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:56.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看看还很小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可怜啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么…能死…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女除妖师？你还活着啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们多年来对除妖师的怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎都发泄完了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好心告诉你们这个山寨的除妖师都出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然连我都想攻击吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知好歹的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山寨？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来那些妖怪的目标…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟妖怪战斗过了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座山寨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们一直在找的除妖师的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有四魂碎片的气息呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全被抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上去追的话说不定能追上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先把这些村民埋葬了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖怪活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.09,0:18:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那个声音是犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静下来 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人不是你的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好想念您
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会在这种地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认识啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是犬夜叉的家臣 算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 这里是除妖师隐居的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎世世代代都是除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪那些妖怪会这么怨恨他们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是偏偏趁这个时候来袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村里的高手都被召入城中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好是村子的防御最薄弱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的心里面一直觉得很不安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.35,0:19:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被召入城中的人们没事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少还有你一个人活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不回答少主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫做珊瑚对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的父亲 还有弟弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和同伴都…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？为什么会发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听从您的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快马加鞭 赶到了除妖师的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到村子里的人都被杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来还想向村里人打听许多事情的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道些什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指四魂之玉的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你是在这里调查玉的事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很早以前就十分在意了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉到底是什么东西呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为跟玉扯上关系的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后都会遭遇不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.90,0:21:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追踪着四魂之玉的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后就来到了这个村庄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有一件事我很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,途中一直都能看到一个白狒狒的身影出没
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白狒狒！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落…他就在这附近…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.81,0:21:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把详细情况告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在除妖师的村落看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了横尸遍野的村民
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和袭击村子的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字叫犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉企图利用四魂之玉的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能他认为能在除妖师的村落得到四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会袭击那个村子的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我的武器…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.95,0:22:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个袭击村子的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去杀了那个叫犬夜叉的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚听说袭击自己村子的是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:55.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用尽最后的力量向犬夜叉袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.73,0:23:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的身体根本不能再战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.73,0:24:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挥舞著名叫飞来骨的回力标的珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上奇怪地闪烁着四魂碎片的光
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切又是那家伙的诡计
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.00,0:24:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对变身后的奈落 犬夜叉用铁碎牙发起攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.81,0:24:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 犬夜叉 摧毁奈落的诡计！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.31,0:24:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.31,0:24:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:26.01,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(278,291)}女除妖师 被奈落设计灭族
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:26.01,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(291,418)}使用名叫飞来骨的巨大回力标
